This integration was written by an AI model (Anthropic Claude Opus 5).

The BLE protocol of the Xiaomi / Viomi Mi Smart Kettle was reverse engineered by
https://github.com/aprosvetova/xiaomi-kettle - this project reimplements it on top of
the Home Assistant Bluetooth stack and adds the write path (keep-warm temperature and
mode, keep-warm time limit, do-not-boil-again).

Other implementations consulted while building this:
  https://github.com/drndos/mikettle
  https://github.com/devbis/ble2mqtt
  https://github.com/Hypfer/Cybele
